            "paragraph": "The MCB strategy in this study is designed based on the SSP1-1.9 scenario, which is often used to represent the carbon-neutral pathway. The objective of MCB in this study is to restrain the time-varying global mean ERF of anthropogenic aerosols under the SSP1-1.9 scenario to the 2020 level by injecting SSA in the four selected marine areas over the eastern Pacific Ocean. First, two atmosphere-only experiments, FSSP119_AA and FSSP119_MCB, are performed to respectively assess the ERF changes due to future reductions in anthropogenic aerosols and the combined effect of anthropogenic aerosol reduction and MCB perturbation on ERF.",
